 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The flood swept them away without a sound",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.11,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They knew nothing of what was coming around",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So it will be when the Son of Man arrives",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Taking one and leaving the other alive",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do you know the day that your Lord appears?",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Or the hour of night that no one hears?",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If the owner knew the thief would come",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He would keep watch to guard the whole world",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So stay awake because the time is near",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Be ready for the moment that you fear",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Son of Man comes at an unexpected hour",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep your eyes open, stay in power",
